    <h1>1. Accessing the Portal & Authentication</h1>
    <p>Users access their respective portals via the centralized login interface (http://localhost:5173/login). The web application redirects users to their designated dashboard route depending on their verified role in the User sheet database. Default accounts are listed below:</p>

